.SH CUSTOM INPUT FOR EACH DEVICE
By adding a variable with the same name as an device name follow with
_input_gain suffix the script will use that input gain instead of using
the value in \f[B]input_gain\f[R]
.PD 0
.P
.PD
Note: if the device name contain \(lq.\(rq or \(lq\-\(rq they need to be
replaced with \(lq_\(rq to work.
